# Storm counts every spell cast before it this turn, whoever cast it (CR 702.40a). Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt in Bot1's
# upkeep and Bot1 casts Mox Sapphire, so Brain Freeze on turn 3 is copied twice. The copies' controller may choose new
# targets (CR 702.40a, 707.10c): the first copy is aimed at Bot1 itself, the second keeps Bot2. Bot2 mills 3 twice, Bot1 once.

